# Fault F9 (W-A): `flows` of decisions refused `RUN-ORDER` printed 0.00. E §4.2 step 5: a refused leg "isn't booked
# ... and so is every read of the refused leg itself (`flows` of its move over a span that holds it)" refused; L §5.14.2
# Cycles: an unordered cycle whose days aren't known at load is refused at run (`RUN-ORDER`). p and q each read x, which
# the other changes, on the day d: flows of each and the balance are refused (a, and a2 with d pinned).
=== m.tally
model t8
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source src "s"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
place x: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place w: outside lives 2000-01-01..
input d: date
move p: transfers
  on d
  reads x
  leg cash from x to w amount max(0, bal(x))
move q: transfers
  on d
  reads x
  leg cash from x to w amount max(0, bal(x))
ask a: flows(p, d..d), flows(q, d..d), bal(x, d)
ask a2: flows(p, 2026-01-15..2026-01-15), bal(x, 2026-01-15) with d = 2026-01-15
version v
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d = 2026-01-15
=== expect
a: (refused: RUN-ORDER decisions p and q read each other on 2026-01-15, refused: RUN-ORDER decisions p and q read each other on 2026-01-15, refused: RUN-ORDER decisions p and q read each other on 2026-01-15)
  cut 2026-01-15
a2: (refused: RUN-ORDER decisions p and q read each other on 2026-01-15, refused: RUN-ORDER decisions p and q read each other on 2026-01-15)
  pinned: d = 2026-01-15
  cut 2026-01-15
